docs {
Daftar log backup. Cursor-based, terbaru dulu. Hanya admin/root.
Trigger console: API insert pending -> processing; CI update ke succeeded/failed.
Cron / Run workflow manual: CI insert baris baru.
Status: pending | processing | succeeded | failed (running = legacy).
Baris pending/processing > 30 menit otomatis failed ("Timeout - workflow tidak melapor") saat list dibaca.

200:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "01J…",
          "created_at": "2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z",
          "triggered_by_username": "admin",
          "trigger_source": "console",
          "status": "succeeded",
          "size_bytes": 542280,
          "release_url": "https://github.com/sambasku/sqlite/releases/tag/backup-…",
          "dry_run": false
        }
      ],
      "meta": { "limit": 20, "next_cursor": null, "has_more": false }
    }

size_bytes = ukuran file .tar.gz.age (terenkripsi), bukan raw .db.
}

meta {
  name: List Database Backup Logs
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/system/database/backups?limit=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

tests {
  test("status 200 + envelope list + meta cursor", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data).to.be.an('array');
    expect(res.body.meta).to.have.property('has_more');
    expect(res.body.meta.limit).to.equal(20);
  });
}
